simulator lang=spectre
subckt rf_tspc3ac_s2_v12 (rf clk vdd vss)
C0 (rf g0) capacitor c=1p
R0 (g0 a) resistor r=20k
X0 (g0 a vdd vss) pll_inv wn=4u wp=10u
C1 (a g1) capacitor c=1p
R1 (g1 b) resistor r=20k
X1 (g1 b vdd vss) pll_inv wn=4u wp=10u
C2 (b g2) capacitor c=1p
R2 (g2 c) resistor r=20k
X2 (g2 c vdd vss) pll_inv wn=4u wp=10u
XO (c clk vdd vss) pll_inv wn=8u wp=20u
ends rf_tspc3ac_s2_v12
